 come to know the truth."],"jaJP":["理解を求めようとは思わない、いずれみんなが真実を知ることになるのだから"]},"keys":["Voice_plague_doctor_1_TouchReactionBad2","cv_plague_doctor_TouchReactionBad2"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/566/5660034@6709184584662619459"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/566/5660034"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/566/5660034@-2459620637725851763"]},"audioName":"5660034"},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["一封信…无法留下足够的记录。"],"enUS":["A letter… It's far too inadequate for record-keeping."],"jaJP":["手紙か…語り継ぐ手段としてはまるで物足りないな"]},"keys":["Voice_plague_doctor_1_NoticeMail","cv_plague_doctor_NoticeMail"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/566/5660035@3265777280872883754"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/566/5660035"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/566/5660035@-8878464370263281306"]},"audioName":"5660035"},{"type":"NoticeEvent","label":"活动提示","texts":{"zhCN":["这场庆典必定充满欢乐，下一场，再下一场，都会如此。"],"enUS":["This event will be full of joy. As will the next one, and the next."],"jaJP":["この祭りでも、楽しめるものがたくさんあるはずだ…次の祭りでも…その次の祭りでも"]},"keys":["cv_plague_doctor_NoticeEvent"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/566/5660036@-2346412714364200898"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/566/5660036"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/566/5660036@2740925624404601025"]},"audioName":"5660036"},{"type":"SummonSpeech1","label":"召唤-台词1","texts":{"zhCN":["其实，你没必要这么怕我。"],"enUS":["You don't need to fear me."],"jaJP":["私を恐れる必要などない"]},"keys":["cv_plague_doctor_SummonSpeech1"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/566/5660094@1418103900533081365"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"5660094"},{"type":"SummonSpeech2","label":"召唤-台词2","texts":{"zhCN":["我只希望大家能够获得真正意义上的解脱。"],"enUS":["All I desire is true liberation."],"jaJP":["私が望むのは、真の意味での解放、それだけなのだから"]},"keys":["cv_plague_doctor_SummonSpeech2"],